<p>Syndicate Bank			    5.6	  8.4</p>
<p>Dena Bank				   7.4	  8.3</p>
<p>Punjab National Bank		    9.1	  8.2</p>
<p>UCO Bank				    8.1	  7.8</p>
<p>Indian Overseas Bank		    8.4	  5.9</p>
<p>Punjab &amp; Sind Bank			5.4	  5.5</p>
<p>Andhra Bank				 4.9	  5.1</p>
<p>United Bank of India		    2.5	  3.5</p>
